  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership for Progress campaign</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this campaign is to inform and engage a young and socio-economically empowered audience, by illustrating the EUs long-term commitment to supporting and investing in human development and building resilient livelihoods in Bangladesh, with a particular focus on the work we do under our budget support interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
